{"sourceUrl":"https://ccst.jlu.edu.cn/info/1229/21077.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:13.199568+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ccst.jlu.edu.cn/info/1229/21077.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为了加深全国优秀大学生对吉林大学计算机科学与技术学院的了解，促进国内高校计算机专业优秀本科生之间的交流，特举办</span><span>“吉林大学计算机科学与技术学院202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年校园学术活动开放日</span><span>”活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.全国各高校计算机、数学、电子等相关专业202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.对计算机专业领域的学术研究有浓厚兴趣，有一定的科研潜力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.成绩优异，具有所在学校推免生资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.英语水平良好。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>活动安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>活动时间：</span> 202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>7月</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>——7月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>活动地点：</span></span><span><span>吉林大学前卫南区王湘浩楼</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>活动内容：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）学生报到</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）学术活动</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3）师生见面会</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4）</span></span><span><span>学生考核</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、申请方法</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.网上报名：申请人通过“开放日报名”系统（网址为</span></span><a href=\"https://yzbbm.jlu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yzbbm.jlu.edu.cn/</a><a href=\"http://10.100.60.12:8888/%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></a><span><span>如实填写个人相关信息，打印报名表。</span></span><span><span>每名学生有两个填报机会，每个学院只可选择一个专业报名</span><span>，</span><strong><span>我院只接收第一志愿报名学生</span></strong><span>。</span></span><span><span>网上报名时间：</span></span><span><span>2026年6月6日8:00</span></span><span><span>——</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>月</span><span>2</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8:00</span></span><span><span>，逾期不予受理。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.材料提交：</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>月</span><span>2</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>日前将以下材料按照顺序扫描形成一个完整的</span><span>pdf文档，文档命名格式为：“本科学校+姓名+开放日”，发送电子版至</span></span><strong><span><span>1361389605@qq.com</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>邮件名称</span><span>“本科学校+姓名+开放日”）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）《开放日报名表》</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>系统生成</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）</span></span><span><span>本科阶段成绩单原件（前</span><span>5个学期成绩，吉林大学计算机科学与技术学院和软件学院学生不需要提供）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3）其他证明材料复印件（包括已发表学术论文；参加科研项目材料；各类获奖证书；大创项目结题证书；英语四六级，托福，雅思和GRE成绩单等）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、选拔考核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.学院专家组根据申请者提供材料进行资格审查，确定参加开放日学生名单在学院网站公布。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.参加开放日同学请于</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>月</span><span>2</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>日前加入</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>CCST开放日Q</span></span><span>Q</span><span><span>群：</span></span><span>567849746</span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.学院对学生进行学术能力考核。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span>五、其它事宜</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.我院开放日</span></span><span><span>不收取任何费用</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>入选</span></span><span><span>学生</span></span><span><span>的交通</span></span><span><span>和食</span></span><span><span>宿费自理。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>.所有相关事宜均在吉林大学计算机科学与技术学院网站公布，不再另行通知，</span></span><span><span>请随时关注网站信息。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.本通知及未尽事宜由吉林大学计算机科学与技术学院负责解释。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七、联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：钟老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0</span></span><span>431</span><span><span>-</span></span><span>85166495</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>欢迎各高校计算机相关学科优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></span></strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"a59839e367dafff3ad3b5d3702dcc0c64735820eecec9e83c7d06cc84b4ed345","textLength":928,"sourceSha256":"cd915a5cfcd59e7ff54d4d1904777b8db151305baa02d7bdcab23d4c730f18f7","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-da621631e54ed9464eb8","title":"2026年吉林大学计算机科学与技术学院2026年校园学术活动开放日”的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:13.199568+00:00"}
